WEBVTT

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:04.166
You got a real sweaty palm
there, buddy. [chuckles]

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.458
[Embarrassment whimpering]

00:00:05.541 --> 00:00:07.250
Hey, do you wanna
come with me, actually?

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:08.583
You can meet some of
the other Fire Hawks.

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:09.750
[Anxiety] Ooh,
this is exciting.

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:12.041
But we can't let her know
we're excited.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.166
Yeah, sounds good.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.583
What emotion was that?

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.791
That's Ennui.

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.708
-An-what?
-[female voice 2 sighs]

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:20.000
Ennui.

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:22.625
It's what you would call
the boredom.

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:25.375
Well, come on up here, An-wer.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:26.708
Am I saying it right?

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.208
An-wah. No.

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:30.291
Oh, nicknames!
I'm gonna call you Wee-Wee.

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:31.625
No.

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:33.541
How are you driving?

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.291
-Console app.
-[beeps]

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:37.208
Hey! Stop it! That's enough.

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:39.250
Now, now,
I know new emotions

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:42.041
can sometimes feel
unhelpful at first,

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.125
and you just wanna...
[grunting]

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.208
say to them,
"Why are you so annoying?"

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:51.125
But I've learned that every
emotion is good for Riley.

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.333
-Even this turkey.
-[Sadness chuckles]

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:55.125
Okay, fine.

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:56.416
[Ennui sighs]

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.583
Cool. Lead the way.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:59.750
All right. Grab your stuff
and follow me.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.458
[Sadness] Oh, but what about
our friends?

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:03.375
[Envy] Val is our future.

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:04.875
Yes, I agree completely.

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:06.125
We need new friends or else

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:08.166
we'll be totally alone
in high school.

00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.333
-Right, Joy?
-Well...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.666
-I mean, maybe, um...
-Here we go!

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:11.833
Wait up.

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:13.708
Thanks for showing me around.

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:15.000
Wait, why did you do that?

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:16.458
Sorry. What did I do?

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.291
We just left
our best friends behind.

00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:20.250
But what about the new ones
that we're about to meet?

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:21.333
No. Okay.

00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:24.375
These next three days need
to be about Bree and Grace.

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.708
Joy, the next three days
could determine

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:28.625
the next four years
of our lives.

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.625
[chuckles] Now, I think
that's overstating things a bit.

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:34.000
Ooh, la, la.
Joy is so old school.

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:35.166
What?

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.583
Look, we all have a job to do.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.916
You make Riley happy,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Sadness makes her sad,

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:41.333
Fear protects her from
the scary stuff she can see,

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.125
and my job is to protect her

00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:44.791
from the scary stuff
she can't see.

00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:46.833
I plan for the future.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.791
Oh, I can show you.
You're gonna love this.

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:51.875
[console beeps]

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.500
I was using that
as a cup holder.

00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:55.791
Okay, so my team
has run all the data,

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.125
and we're looking
at the following

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:58.250
likely scenarios.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.208
First, we don't take
this camp seriously,

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:01.416
and we goof off
with Bree and Grace.

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.916
Riley looks really uncool
in front of Val.

00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:05.166
She fails to
impress the coach,

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.541
does not become a Fire Hawk,

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:08.291
and finally arrives
at high school.

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:09.791
-She has no one.
-[bell ringing]

00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:11.833
She eats alone,
and only the teachers

00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:13.166
-know her name.
-Ew.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.666
Okay, you and I
are gonna be friends.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:17.125
Oh, this is a sad story.

00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.083
It's a ridiculous story.

00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:21.791
Look, again, love the energy,
but you're being silly.

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.416
None of this
will actually happen.

00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:24.833
Right. Whatever you say.

00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:26.333
-You're the boss. [chuckles]
-[female voice 3] Oh...

00:02:26.416 --> 00:02:30.125
Remember when we all finally
came up to Headquarters?

00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:32.833
That was like 30 seconds ago,
Nostalgia.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.083
Yeah, those were the days.

00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:37.708
Nostalgia, you aren't supposed
to be here yet.

00:02:37.791 --> 00:02:40.125
You still have about 10 years,
two graduations,

00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:41.833
and a best friend's wedding
before you're invited,

00:02:41.916 --> 00:02:43.500
but I will keep you
in the loop, I promise.

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:44.708
-[Valentina] All right...
-Hey, hey...

00:02:44.791 --> 00:02:45.833
-you ready, Riley?
-everybody focus!

00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:48.250
Val is leading us
into their holy inner sanctum!

00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:49.750
-And here we are!
-[indistinct chatter]

00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.541
[Envy] These girls are so cool!

00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:56.625
[Disgust] And older.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:57.958
We are not changing
in front of them.

00:02:58.125 --> 00:02:59.166
It's fine!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.000
Locker rooms are places
of mutual respect.

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:03.416
Hey, come on! I want you to
meet the other Fire Hawks.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.500
-Hey, girl!
-What's up?

00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:05.875
Hey.

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:07.416
Riley is from Michigan.

00:03:07.583 --> 00:03:09.541
Okay, we're stuck with that.

00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:11.500
Oh, Cool. Where in Michigan
are you from?

00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:13.333
-Uh...
-Oh, no. What now?

00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:15.250
Okay, looks like
we're committing to this.

00:03:15.416 --> 00:03:16.541
Cities in Michigan...

00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:17.750
We need to make something up.

00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:20.125
I'm from all over.

00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:21.791
Nice. See you out there.

00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:23.250
Hey, you wanna sit with us?

00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:24.916
[Anxiety]
Oh, she wants to sit with us.

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.416
[gasps]
Everything is beautiful!

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.583
There's not enough room
for Bree and Grace.

00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:31.375
Oh! Let's go sit over there.

00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:33.250
I was gonna go save seats
for my friends.

00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:34.750
But thanks anyway.

00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:36.833
Oh. Uh... Yeah. Okay.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:37.916
No worries.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.708
See? Was that so hard?

00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:40.875
No. You're totally right.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.291
That decision's
not gonna haunt us

00:03:42.375 --> 00:03:43.833
for the rest
of our lives at all.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.458
-[Bree] No way!
-Bree and Grace!

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:47.916
-There you are.
-Riley.

00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:50.791
Time to celebrate!

00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:53.291
-Say, "awooga"!
-[both] Awooga!

00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:55.750
Okay, ladies.
Let's all settle in.

00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:58.750
[babbling, chuckling]

00:03:59.291 --> 00:04:01.166
-Uh, Joy?
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.291
-[coach] Ladies!
-[girls gasp]

00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:04.500
Settle in means settle down.

00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:06.166
I need your focus.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.500
Which means now I'm going
to need your cell phones.

00:04:08.583 --> 00:04:09.583
All of 'em.

00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:11.875
[girl] Wait, what?
Are you serious?

00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:16.166
[tuts] You're here
to work, not goof around.

00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:17.375
Got that, Andersen?

00:04:19.083 --> 00:04:20.125
Yes, Coach.

00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:22.416
Please put all your phones
in the basket.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.250
You get them back
at the end of camp.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.625
Wow. Coach is so serious.

00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:31.958
Joy, I'm just curious.
Maybe, um, I could help...

00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.125
Thank you. Not now.

00:04:33.291 --> 00:04:34.458
I know, right? [laughs]

00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:35.958
[all chuckling]

00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:38.541
Oh. [chuckles]
You think this is funny?

00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:40.291
Uh-huh. Well, you know
what else is funny?

00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:41.500
Skating lines.

00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:43.125
-Now hit the ice, ladies.
-[all groaning]

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:45.291
-Great job, Michigan.
-Thanks a lot, new girl.

00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:46.666
[girl 1] Just make her do it.

00:04:47.291 --> 00:04:50.583
[sighs] Bravo, Joy.
She's totally fitting in now.

00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.541
Oh, thanks so much, Wee-Wee.

00:04:52.666 --> 00:04:54.041
[all panting]

00:04:56.416 --> 00:04:58.125
You're lagging behind,
Andersen!

00:04:58.291 --> 00:05:00.208
-Skate harder!
-[player] This is the worst.

00:05:00.291 --> 00:05:01.291
[whistle blows]

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:03.458
All right, ladies,
take a breather.

00:05:03.625 --> 00:05:05.416
Then we'll divide into teams.

00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:08.166
[breathing heavily]

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:12.958
[Fire Hawk player]
Oh, that Michigan girl

00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:15.000
-is off to a rough start.
-[Anxiety] Oh, no.

00:05:15.166 --> 00:05:16.375
Are they talking about us?

00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:18.125
Yeah, there's no way
Coach is putting her

00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:19.708
on the team if she can't
get it together.

00:05:19.791 --> 00:05:21.916
Uh, okay, Dani,
like you had it all together

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.000
when you were a freshman?

00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:24.416
I wasn't that immature.

00:05:24.583 --> 00:05:28.750
[Sofia] Dani, you stuck straws
up your nose. Like last night.

00:05:29.291 --> 00:05:30.291
[Embarrassment groaning]

00:05:31.291 --> 00:05:32.458
[grunting]

00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:34.666
Aw. I got you, big guy.

00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:37.375
-[sobbing]
-[Envy] Oh.

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:41.041
I always wanted people to talk
about us, but not like this.

00:05:41.125 --> 00:05:43.083
Oh, Joy, what do we do now?

00:05:43.291 --> 00:05:44.291
Um...

00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:45.500
We can just, um...

00:05:45.666 --> 00:05:46.916
I have an idea.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.000
Okay.

00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:51.833
If we can get Val on our side,
everything will be great.

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:57.208
Uh, Val?

00:05:57.291 --> 00:05:58.958
Oh, hey, Riley. What's up?

00:05:59.041 --> 00:06:00.166
Uh, I-I...

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.375
I'm so sorry.

00:06:03.541 --> 00:06:05.458
I didn't mean to get
the whole team skating lines.

00:06:05.625 --> 00:06:06.666
I feel terrible.

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:08.000
I respect you so much.

00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:09.541
I would never do anything
to mess you up.

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:11.000
Uh, that's laying it on
a bit thick, don't you think?

00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:12.166
-[shushes] Joy.
-You're a great hockey player,

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.833
and you lead the team
so amazingly,

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:15.000
and I really
look up to you and...

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:16.958
Okay, okay. Thanks. [chuckles]

00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:19.583
Listen, Coach was pretty hard
on you today,

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.208
but that's not a bad thing.

00:06:21.375 --> 00:06:22.708
It means you're on her radar.

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:23.833
Really?

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.708
Listen, I'm glad you came
to talk with me.

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:27.875
Hey, let's try to be on
the same team later, okay?

00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:29.458
Oh, yeah. Cool.

00:06:29.541 --> 00:06:30.541
-[sighs wearily]
-Wow.

00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:32.250
-[Ennui] Good job. Wow.
-I wish I could do that.

00:06:32.416 --> 00:06:34.625
You guys, I mean,
it really wasn't anything.

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.250
I'm just trying to help.

00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:37.708
I agree.

00:06:37.875 --> 00:06:40.000
Great job, Anxiety.

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:42.125
I stepped back,
you stepped in,

00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:45.000
you got Riley back on track,
now I'm ready to step back in.

00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:46.791
But that was just
part one of my plan.

00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:48.041
There's a part two?

00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:50.666
A good plan
has many parts, Joy.

00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:52.583
Okay, ladies,
we're gonna form your teams

00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:53.666
for the rest of camp.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.041
Now, split yourselves
down the middle.

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:58.208
Team one on the right,
team two on the left.

00:06:58.375 --> 00:06:59.375
Let's do this!

00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:00.750
One more time
on the same team, right?

00:07:00.916 --> 00:07:01.916
Right.

00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:05.208
Val wants us.

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:06.916
But we promised
Bree and Grace.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.791
Joy, we have to
plan for the future.

00:07:11.625 --> 00:07:13.333
Come on, Riley, move.
Move those feet!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.666
Val's on team one,
you wanna be on team one.

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:15.833
Let's go.

00:07:15.916 --> 00:07:17.500
She made a promise
to her friends.

00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:19.333
She's not gonna break it.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.833
Oh, you're so right, Joy.

00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:22.583
-[grunts]
-[shatters]

00:07:22.666 --> 00:07:23.708
-What are you doing?
-[Anger] Hey!

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:27.291
No! You can't have that.
Put that back.

00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:31.375
Joy, I don't mean
to overstep...

00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:32.458
-No!
-...but it has to be done.

00:07:32.541 --> 00:07:34.041
What are you... No!

